    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Article 32 was termed the 'Heart and Soul' of the Constitution by Dr. B.R. Ambedkar.",
        "Fundamental rights under Articles 20 and 21 cannot be suspended even during a National Emergency.",
        "Writs can be issued by the Supreme Court under Article 32 and by High Courts under Article 226."
      ],
